flowchart TD
  Auth[Firebase Auth UID] --> Identity["users/{uid}"]
  Identity --> Active{active?}
  Active -->|não| Deny[Negar]
  Active -->|sim| Global{platformRole?}
  Global -->|platform_owner| Platform[Área /platform + logs globais]
  Global -->|sem papel global| Slug[Resolve tenant slug]
  Slug --> Status{tenant ACTIVE?}
  Status -->|não| Deny
  Status -->|sim| Membership["tenants/{id}/members/{uid}"]
  Membership --> MemberState{membership ACTIVE?}
  MemberState -->|não| Deny
  MemberState -->|sim| Role{tenant role}
  Role --> Owner[tenant_owner: administração do tenant]
  Role --> Admin[admin: operação administrativa local]
  Role --> Staff[staff: operação permitida]
  Role --> Driver[driver: entregas atribuídas]
